<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_凝视、窥探、瞥见、聆听与嗅闻 (Gazing, Peering, Glimpsing, Eavesdropping & Sniffing)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 12 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>stare<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>stare<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to stare</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/stєә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/stare/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('stare', 'stare')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 注视, 凝视, 瞪视, 显眼；vt. 盯</td><td class='def-en'>look at with fixed eyes</td><td>3.91</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>stare down</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>gaze</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The students stared at the teacher with amazement”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>behold<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>regarder<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to behold</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/bi'hәuld/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁəgaʁde/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('behold', 'regarder')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 看到, 注视；vi. 看</td><td class='def-en'>see with attention</td><td>3.76</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>lay eyes on</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“behold Christ!”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>gaze<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>gaze<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to gaze</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/geiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/gaz/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('gaze', 'gaze')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 注视, 凝视</td><td class='def-en'>look at with fixed eyes</td><td>3.7</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>stare down</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>stare</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The students stared at the teacher with amazement”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>advert<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>assister<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to advert</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/әd'vә:t/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/asiste/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('advert', 'assister')">🔊</button></td><td>vi. 提出看法, 引起注意, 留意</td><td class='def-en'>give heed (to)</td><td>3.46</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>give ear</span><span class='pv-pill'>pay heed</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>attend</span><span class='nt-pill'>hang</span><span class='nt-pill'>allude</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The children in the audience attended the recital quietly”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>wiretap<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>intercepter<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to wiretap</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'waiәtæp/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃tɛʁsɛpte/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wiretap', 'intercepter')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 搭线窃听</td><td class='def-en'>tap a telephone or telegraph wire to get information</td><td>2.69</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>listen in</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>intercept</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>tap</span><span class='nt-pill'>bug</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“The FBI was tapping the phone line of the suspected spy”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>overhear<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>overhear<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to overhear</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.әuvә'hiә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/overhear/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('overhear', 'overhear')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 无意中听到, 偷听</td><td class='def-en'>hear, usually without the knowledge of the speakers</td><td>2.65</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>take in</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>catch</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“We overheard the conversation at the next table”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>eavesdrop<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>aux<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to eavesdrop</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'i:vzdrɒp/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/o/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('eavesdrop', 'aux')">🔊</button></td><td>v. 偷听</td><td class='def-en'>listen without the speaker's knowledge</td><td>2.48</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>listen in</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“the jealous man was eavesdropping on his wife's conversations”</div></div></td></tr>
